<section class="content-ui-section" style="padding: 55px 0; background: #0b132b; color: #cbd5e1; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07);">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 1060px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 15px;">
    <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.65); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 16px; padding: 36px 32px; box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.35);">
      <span style="background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.12); color: #f59e0b; border: 1px solid rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.35); padding: 4px 14px; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 14px;">DESTINATION PROTOCOL</span>
      <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.35; margin-bottom: 18px;">Doorstep Delivery Handover, Inventory Verification &amp; Placement at West</h2>
      <div style="font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #cbd5e1;"><p>At West, the final delivery and uncrating protocol is designed to guarantee a flawless handover, protect the integrity of every item, and maintain a pristine environment. The process is carried out in a single, daylight‑lit shift to leverage natural lighting for accurate inspection.</p>

<p>Daylight delivery verification begins immediately upon arrival. The delivery team cross‑checks the shipment against the original inventory bilty, confirming the quantity, model numbers, and serial numbers for each piece.</p>
<p>A two‑step audit is performed: first, the team records a photo‑log of every item against its bilty entry; second, the inventory clerk verifies the photos and marks each item as “verified.” Any discrepancies trigger an immediate stop‑delivery procedure and a corrective action log.</p>

<p>Once verification is complete, the electrical and mechanical items undergo a functional test. A dedicated test station is set up with calibrated power supplies and diagnostic tools.</p>
<p>Each appliance, fixture, and mechanical component is powered on, inspected for proper operation, and logged with test results. If an item fails the test, it is isolated, repaired or replaced on the spot, and a detailed repair record is entered into the West asset management system.</p>

<p style="font-size: 1.04rem; line-height: 1.75; color: #f1f5f9; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 12px;">After testing, the team moves on to clean furniture placement.</p>
<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 16px 0 20px 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;"><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>Each piece is carefully positioned on its designated spot, following the layout plan approved by the client.</span></li><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>Furniture is cleaned with microfiber cloths and appropriate cleaners before placement to ensure a spotless finish.</span></li><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>The team also double‑checks that all hardware is tightened and that the furniture meets ergonomic and safety standards.</span></li></ul></div>
